图像识别/分类不是媒体创作，没有贴切类别归other；量化、计算与领域研究归search-research，不因多智能体实现归agents-automation；模型/CLI适配与插件开发工具归coding-development；市场/精选目录按搜索发现归search-research。不要按附属同步、备份或评论功能分类。不要推断本机客户端等于本地模型。
摘要中的主要功能必须被所选片段支持。优先把改变用途含义的条件写进摘要，不能只藏在limitations。遇到“阶段1骨架”“cloud provider待实现”“匿名thread后续实现”等，摘要明确当前仅本地草稿/审批落盘，不说已实现匿名网络或云端发布。Codex/模型登录适配归coding-development；Oopz等语音房的对话连接归communication-integrations。自述兼容或性能用“作者称/README注明”，不冒充本次验证。
格式示例（仅结构，不是来源事实）：evidence:[{"paragraph_id":"p3s1","fact":"该片段支持的中文转述"}]。请从本次真实输入挑选编号。","role":"system"},{"content":"{"metadata":{"description":"Provider quota/balance widget for the dsh web surface: capsule + card + settings panel, dual-face (loopback RPC host half + shell.overlay client half), zero npm deps","id":"gh:1334348684","install_available":true,"language":"JavaScript","name":"dsh-quota-panel","slug":"wenzetan/dsh-quota-panel","topics":["balance","deepseek-harness","dsh-plugin","quota"]},"paragraphs":[{"id":"p1s1","text":"Provider quota/balance widget for the dsh web surface: capsule + card + settings panel, dual-face (l"},{"id":"p1s2","text":"oopback RPC host half + shell.overlay client half), zero npm deps"},{"id":"p2s1","text":"# dsh-quota-panel"},{"id":"p3s1","text":"English | 中文"},{"id":"p4s1","text":"**dsh-quota-panel** is a **provider quota / balance status widget** for the\nDeepSeek Harness (DSH) *"},{"id":"p4s2","text":"*web surface** (`dsh web`). It sits in the\nbottom-right corner of the product UI, watches every AI p"},{"id":"p4s3","text":"rovider whose API\nkey you have configured, and tells you at a glance how much balance /\nquota is lef"},{"id":"p4s4","text":"t — DeepSeek, OpenRouter, SiliconFlow, Moonshot, StepFun,\nxAI, Zhipu GLM, OpenCode Go, Volcengine Ar"},{"id":"p4s5","text":"k (Agent/Coding Plan), plus one-api / new-api style aggregators,\nand the **coding plans** (智谱 GLM Co"},{"id":"p4s6","text":"ding, Z.AI, Kimi Coding, MiniMax\nCoding global/CN) with 5-hour / weekly usage windows and MCP monthl"},{"id":"p4s7","text":"y quota.\nxAI, Zhipu GLM, OpenCode Go, **ChatGPT subscription (Plus/Pro via Codex\nlogin)**, plus one-"},{"id":"p4s8","text":"api / new-api style aggregators, and the **coding\nplans** (智谱 GLM Coding, Z.AI, Kimi Coding, MiniMax"},{"id":"p4s9","text":" Coding global/CN)\nwith 5-hour / weekly usage windows and MCP monthly quota."},{"id":"p5s1","text":"Since v0.5 it is a **dual-face plugin** with a **built-in provider catalog\nand auto discovery**: ins"},{"id":"p5s2","text":"tall it, restart `dsh web`, and every provider\nwhose key resolves automatically appears on the panel"},{"id":"p5s3","text":" — zero configuration.\nIt needs **no npm dependencies** and asks for **no `allowBuilds` authorizatio"},{"id":"p5s4","text":"ero configuration.\nIt needs **no npm dependencies** and asks for **no `allowBuilds` authorization**."},{"id":"p6s1","text":"## Supported features"},{"id":"p7s1","text":"- **Auto discovery** — the host half ships a catalog of well-known\nproviders; each entry names the p"},{"id":"p7s2","text":"rovider's standard credential\nreferences, and **every provider whose key resolves\n(`$DSH_HOME/.crede"},{"id":"p7s3","text":"ntials.yaml` / `.env` / environment variables)\nappears on the panel automatically**, with zero confi"},{"id":"p7s4","text":"g. Remove the key\nand the row disappears. No credential enumeration API exists in DSH, so\nthe catalo"},{"id":"p7s5","text":"g is probed each refresh cycle.\n- **Coding-plan usage windows** — GLM / Z.AI / Kimi / MiniMax coding"},{"id":"p7s6","text":"\nplans render as usage rows: 5-hour window, weekly pool and (GLM/Z.AI)\nthe MCP monthly lane, each wi"},{"id":"p7s7","text":"th its own reset countdown; windows the\nplan does not carry show `—` instead of a fabricated 0%.\n- *"},{"id":"p7s8","text":"*Two sizes** — collapsed: a minimal capsule with one independent\n\"status dot + value\" pair per accou"},{"id":"p7s9","text":"nt (`● ¥58.36 · ● 45%`); expanded: a\nfull card with a row per provider (status dot, name, primary va"},{"id":"p7s10","text":"lue,\nsecondary info, progress bar for usage-kind providers).\n- **Auto refresh** — follows the config"},{"id":"p7s11","text":"ured interval (default 60 s), paused\nwhile the page is hidden; the refresh button spins during a fet"},{"id":"p7s12","text":"ch and\nrepeated clicks never fire concurrent requests.\n- **Per-account status** — balance rows are g"},{"id":"p7s13","text":"raded by tier\n(`critical <= warn <= healthy`), usage rows by percent\n(`error >= warn`); the offendin"},{"id":"p7s14","text":"g dot/value alone recolors, others stay\ncalm. Usage percentages use battery-style three-color gradin"},{"id":"p7s15","text":"g, independent\nof the status dots.\n- **Settings panel (⚙)** — per-provider visibility, refresh inter"},{"id":"p7s16","text":"val,\nper-provider warning thresholds, per-provider **HTTP(S) proxy URL**, the\n**capsule display mode"},{"id":"p7s17","text":"** (auto = highest window — the default — / 5h\nwindow / weekly window / highest), and \"restore defau"},{"id":"p7s18","text":"lts\". All local\nsettings apply immediately, persist to browser localStorage, and are\nnever written t"},{"id":"p7s19","text":"o the profile or uploaded.\n- **Per-row HTTP(S) proxy** — configure a proxy for providers that cannot"},{"id":"p7s20","text":"\nbe reached directly from your network (see below).\n- **One-api / new-api aggregators** — the built-"},{"id":"p7s21","text":"in `openai-billing`\nformat adapts aggregator dashboards.\n- **Theming** — driven entirely by Harness "},{"id":"p7s22","text":"design tokens\n[该节后续省略]"},{"id":"p8s1","text":"## How it works"},{"id":"p9s1","text":"[代码示例省略，未执行]"},{"id":"p10s1","text":"- **Host half** (`lib/index.js`) mounts one exact Fetch route per endpoint on\nthe Connection service"},{"id":"p10s2","text":"'s authenticated `/api` channel, under the\n`dsh-quota-panel` method namespace:\n- `POST /api/dsh-quot"},{"id":"p10s3","text":"a-panel/specs` — the resolved rows with render hints\nonly (id, label, row kind, currency, threshold "},{"id":"p10s4","text":"tiers, window labels,\n[该节后续省略]"},{"id":"p11s1","text":"## Compatibility"},{"id":"p12s1","text":"**One DSH host line at a time.** This package supports exactly the host line\nits `peerDependencies` "},{"id":"p12s2","text":"pin — currently `@deepseek-ai/dsh@0.1.7-rc.1`\n(npm `next`). The five seam packages it actually talks"},{"id":"p12s3","text":" to are declared as\nexact peers:"},{"id":"p13s1","text":"| Seam package (peer, exact) | Used for |"},{"id":"p14s1","text":"| `@deepseek-ai/dsh-client-connection` | host `connection.fetch` RPC routes + browser `connection.rp"},{"id":"p14s2","text":"c` |\n| `@deepseek-ai/dsh-credentials` | host-side `credentials.resolve` |\n| `@deepseek-ai/dsh-client"},{"id":"p14s3","text":"-ui-renderer` | browser `slots` service (`shell.overlay` registration) |\n| `@deepseek-ai/dsh-cordis-"},{"id":"p14s4","text":"client-runner` | browser `timer` service (`ctx.interval`) |\n| `@deepseek-ai/dsh-client-locale` | bro"},{"id":"p14s5","text":"wser `locale` service (dictionaries) |"},{"id":"p15s1","text":"Because those peers are exact versions, a DSH 0.1.7-or-newer host's plugin/host\ncompatibility gate ("},{"id":"p15s2","text":"`evaluatePluginCompatibility`) refuses to install or boot\nthis package on any other host line. That "},{"id":"p15s3","text":"is intentional: **old host lines are\nserved by old plugin versions.** Keep running the release that "},{"id":"p15s4","text":"pinned your DSH\nversion — its tag records which one — and upgrade the plugin together with DSH.\n(Hos"},{"id":"p15s5","text":"t lines older than 0.1.7 have no such gate and simply ignore the\ndeclaration; they are not tested or"},{"id":"p15s6","text":"r than 0.1.7 have no such gate and simply ignore the\ndeclaration; they are not tested or supported.)"},{"id":"p16s1","text":"Verification for the current line lives in the testbed and the CI boot gate;\n`docs/2026-09-24-dsh-0."},{"id":"p16s2","text":"1.7-rc.1-assessment.md`\nrecords the seam-by-seam diff against the previous line."},{"id":"p17s1","text":"## Security"},{"id":"p18s1","text":"- API keys are resolved host-side via `ctx.credentials` and used only for\nhost-side requests to prov"},{"id":"p18s2","text":"iders; the browser talks exclusively to the\nplugin's methods on Connection's authenticated `/api` ch"},{"id":"p18s3","text":"annel\n(`/api/dsh-quota-panel/<method>`), the `specs` endpoint ships\nrender hints only (labels/kinds/"},{"id":"p18s4","text":"thresholds) with no credential or\nendpoint; since v0.5 `fetch-all` ships normalized views only — raw"},{"id":"p18s5","text":"\nupstream JSON stays host-side too.\n- The card builds DOM exclusively with `createElement`/`textCont"},{"id":"p18s6","text":"ent`;\nAPI values never touch `innerHTML`; technical errors (401, timeout,\nmissing credential, refuse"},{"id":"p18s7","text":"d proxy) surface only in `title` tooltips or\ninline row text, and one failing row never affects the "},{"id":"p18s8","text":") surface only in `title` tooltips or\ninline row text, and one failing row never affects the others."}],"truncated":true}","role":"user"}],"model":"MiniMax-M3.1-Flash","reasoning_effort":"low","stream":false}
